  "description": "Listed building consent for upgrade of existing telecommunications equipment at roof level to allow for 4G coverage, the proposed development consists of the following:Existing 3 No. 8-port antennas to be removed and replaced with 3 No. UWB 8-port antenna (same size) on existing support poles.Existing 1 No. antenna breakout box at high level to be relocated from handrail onto new wall mounted support pole.2 No. proposed antenna breakout boxes to be installed on new wall mounted support poles.Existing 6 No. 3262 RRH's, proposed 6 No. 5507 RRH's and proposed 3 No. (1800/2600) diplexers to be mounted on existing/new wall mounted supportpoles. (1800/2600) diplexers to be mounted on brackets to the side of the proposed 5507 RRH's, bracket to have one hole redrilled to fit RRH mountingholes.Existing TMC11H to be removed & relpaced with APM30 ver. D. New 50abreaker to be installed within D/B for 3900A AC power supply.Existing RFC ver C. to be removed and replaced with RFC ver. D, on new MK2 plinth to facilitate cable management.Existing 6 No. 1800MRFU's within 3900A to be disconnected and replaced with blanking plates.Existing 6 No. 1800 feeders to be disconnected and capped for future use.Existing 3 No. 1800 MHA's to be removed.2600 second carrier to be installed as part of 1800 LTE upgrade works and removal of redundant pole.",
